{"ID":"20251113102910-tb0yzj2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251113102910-tb0yzj2","title":"UPL9-13——光照烘焙","type":"doc","updated":"20251114104956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113102910-b7ucose","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251113102910-b7ucose","updated":"20251113105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照烘焙"}]},{"ID":"20251113102944-1h57wlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113102944-1h57wlz","updated":"20251113102950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提前离线计算场景中的光照、阴影、反射、间接光照等信息，并且将结果保存为贴图或探针数据\n在游戏运行时直接使用，从而节省实时计算的性能消耗"}]},{"ID":"20251113102944-xjdi70j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113102944-xjdi70j","updated":"20251113102953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么可以节约性能"}]},{"ID":"20251113102953-k75vfbe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113102953-k75vfbe","updated":"20251113102953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113102953-gkcx20a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113102953-gkcx20a","updated":"20251113102953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113102953-4qovyou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113102953-4qovyou","updated":"20251113102953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实时光照：运行时每帧都需要计算，开销很大"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113102954-6c3u9si","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113102954-6c3u9si","updated":"20251113102954"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113102954-l4n4b7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113102954-l4n4b7e","updated":"20251113102954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烘焙光照：提前计算，运行时直接贴图，几乎零性能开销（因为不用实时计算光照）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113102944-k2xqyg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113102944-k2xqyg1","updated":"20251113103004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：\n提前把光照表现算好存储到光照纹理中，运行时直接使用光照纹理中的颜色用于着色\n避免实时计算带来的高开销，是典型的 内存换性能 的优化方式"}]},{"ID":"20251113103010-0nljcg0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113103010-0nljcg0","updated":"20251113105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哪些光照信息可以被烘焙"}]},{"ID":"20251113103016-93gz9op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103016-93gz9op","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以被烘焙的光照信息："}]},{"ID":"20251113103020-n9fgbkx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-n9fgbkx","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103020-8qfngea","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-8qfngea","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103020-0bkwn8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-0bkwn8o","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直接光照"}]},{"ID":"20251113103021-csx4rnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103021-csx4rnd","updated":"20251113103021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来自光源直接照射到表面的光"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103020-6pk2idz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-6pk2idz","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103020-ydbc4s3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-ydbc4s3","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"间接光照"}]},{"ID":"20251113103022-4saa3es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103022-4saa3es","updated":"20251113103022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光线在场景中多次反射后的柔和照明"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103020-3c1txzl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-3c1txzl","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103020-qg0iynt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-qg0iynt","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阴影"}]},{"ID":"20251113103023-omuzw5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103023-omuzw5c","updated":"20251113103023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可烘焙静态阴影（不会随动态物体移动）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103020-4mxwtb3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-4mxwtb3","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103020-b1oqquw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103020-b1oqquw","updated":"20251113103020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反射"}]},{"ID":"20251113103025-awmavwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103025-awmavwe","updated":"20251113103025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可通过 反射探针（Reflection Probe） 烘焙环境反射"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103016-h14db4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103016-h14db4e","updated":"20251113105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不可被烘焙的光照信息：不支持随时间变化的灯光（包括位置方向和光照强度） 或 移动的光源"}]},{"ID":"20251113103031-zpiygr3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113103031-zpiygr3","updated":"20251113150029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何进行光照烘焙"}]},{"ID":"20251113103047-tblyeo2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103047-tblyeo2","updated":"20251113144953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103153-s22isfg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103153-s22isfg","updated":"20251113103153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103153-2gvr1se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103153-2gvr1se","updated":"20251113110401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将场景中想要进行光照烘焙的静态物体标记为静态 Static，或 只勾选 Contribute GI（Contribute Global Illumination，参与全局光照）"}]},{"ID":"20251113103204-dc5ddpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103204-dc5ddpd","updated":"20251113103204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只有勾选了该选项的物体，才会被当作静态对象进行光照烘焙"}]},{"ID":"20251113103207-uct1442","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113103207-uct1442","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251113103208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113103208-mrmraku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103208-mrmraku","updated":"20251113103208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：动态对象 需要使用 光照探针，不能作为静态对象处理"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113105912-sa0k03m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113105912-sa0k03m","updated":"20251113110034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113110034-o38ktya.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251113110035-rmbbzz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113110035-rmbbzz6","updated":"20251113110039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或者"}]},{"ID":"20251113110039-k7o7xst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113110039-k7o7xst","updated":"20251113110104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113110104-4wrbrfd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103153-bu51z4h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103153-bu51z4h","updated":"20251113103153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103153-2by8049","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103153-2by8049","updated":"20251113103153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"