6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113112846-hdzplsy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251113112036-6ujwirr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113112036-6ujwirr","updated":"20251113112036"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113112036-0zr6j4z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251113112036-0zr6j4z","updated":"20251113112036"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113112036-pzdw662","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113112036-pzdw662","updated":"20251113113353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Baked Indirect（间接烘焙模式，实时内容多，性能开销最大）"}]},{"ID":"20251113113016-lf0djfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113113016-lf0djfo","updated":"20251113113033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只烘焙间接光照（Global Illumination），而直接光照和阴影是实时计算的\n常用于完全实时的场景，只想要烘焙的全局光照“氛围”"}]},{"ID":"20251113113034-oghysag","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113034-oghysag","updated":"20251113113034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113033-n1nc8lc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113033-n1nc8lc","updated":"20251113113033"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113033-lubuiiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113113033-lubuiiw","updated":"20251113113102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烘焙内容：间接光（反射、漫反射反弹）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113113037-bh1mxi1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113037-bh1mxi1","updated":"20251113113037"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113037-ndl0rnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113113037-ndl0rnd","updated":"20251113113058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实时内容：直接光、阴影"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113113058-g1r5zkd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113058-g1r5zkd","updated":"20251113113058"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113058-nj71ckm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113113058-nj71ckm","updated":"20251113113100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态物体：可接收实时光和阴影，但不会接收烘焙阴影"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113113042-mm38d85","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113042-mm38d85","updated":"20251113113042"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113042-a8dzs92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113113042-a8dzs92","updated":"20251113113051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能：较高开销（因为直接光仍是实时计算）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113113047-prq3lqm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113047-prq3lqm","updated":"20251113113047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113047-2qaf8n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113113047-2qaf8n9","updated":"20251113113049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"典型用途：室外场景、昼夜循环、动态光源较多的场景"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113112036-5md3u9a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251113112036-5md3u9a","updated":"20251113112036"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113112036-3z9xh3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113112036-3z9xh3d","updated":"20251113113406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Subtractive（减法模式，实时内容少，性能最好）"}]},{"ID":"20251113112741-ay8xo6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113112741-ay8xo6i","updated":"20251113113151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一种最简化的烘焙+实时混合模式，主要面向 低端移动平台\n只允许 一个主方向光（Directional Light） 提供实时阴影，其余光照全部烘焙进贴图"}]},{"ID":"20251113113152-f58l0vn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113113152-f58l0vn","updated":"20251113113152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113113151-n3wsi72","Type":"NodeLis